":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"950937301483446273","date":1515556094000,"rawContent":"The latest The Sofia Quintero Daily! https:\/\/t.co\/tD1xkB6kGV Thanks to @Uptowncollectiv @HarlemWriter @lauritzin #aspiremag #metoo","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"952201240007663616","date":1515857441000,"rawContent":"I can\u2019t cancel anyone to whom I never subscribed #LiamNeeson #TimesUp #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/CFGyoFwYF7","media":[{"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/tweet_video_thumb\/DTbl-hrVAAMKJlW.jpg","variants":["https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/tweet_video\/DTbl-hrVAAMKJlW.mp4"]}],"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"952749228308205568","date":1515988091000,"rawContent":"The latest The Sofia Quintero Daily! https:\/\/t.co\/kGjBVGh1er Thanks to @bronxbookfest @ajagbeadewole @oneandonlyjoyce #aspiremag #metoo","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"953821631553601542","date":1516243772000,"rawContent":"It's imperative that folks discuss \"Grace\" and #AzizAnsari if we stand any chance at cultivating a sexual culture based on pleasure w\/o violence. But can y'all do that w\/o throwing #MeToo under the bus just bc you take issue with her account? Fickle shit doesn't get anyone free.","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"953824168704962560","date":1516244377000,"rawContent":"If your struggle with one woman's story is all it takes to make you check out of an entire movement that only two days ago hundreds upon thousands of people fit your criteria for victimhood, were you ever about that life? #AzizAnsari #MeToo","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"954017645933801473","date":1516290506000,"rawContent":"The latest The Sofia Quintero Daily! https:\/\/t.co\/znsJMyJ6f3 Thanks to @jamilahking @KamoneFromPluto @thecityofjules #aspiremag #metoo","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":20,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"954198848167137280","date":1516333708000,"rawContent":"The latest The Sofia Quintero Daily! https:\/\/t.co\/unqBYqP1vm Thanks to @EchoingIda @_JoyCastro @mychalsmith #aspiremag #metoo","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":21,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"954554175043571712","date":1516418424000,"rawContent":"The movement against rape culture is broad, longstanding and varied, and #MeToo is an important part of it. It's not all there is to it, however, nor is it going anywhere because you checked out over your fave's humiliation. Whenever there's abuse, there's gonna be resistance","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":22,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"954554174003347456","date":1516418424000,"rawContent":"#MeToo is also about survivors supporting survivors. It's about the spectrum of violation from coercion to rape. It's about healing whether or not accountability is forthcoming.","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":23,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"954554173110013952","date":1516418424000,"rawContent":"Do you really think that one account exposing your fave in shades of gray is going to derail #MeToo? The fight to end rape culture started long before a #hashtag and wasn't ever about ruining celebrities so you can't watch your shows in peace.","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":24,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":12.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"954554176134053888","date":1516418425000,"rawContent":"Any time a movement makes progress, there's backlash. It's par for the course. Backlash is often the resistance before the breakthrough, and that's why true change makers aren't so fragile and fickle. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":25,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"954554177010663425","date":1516418425000,"rawContent":"You think #MeToo and other efforts to end rape culture are *that* pressed about your wealthy and famous faves? They've been comin' for that creepy uncle your fam keeps inviting to the cookout even though he can't be trusted alone with the kids. How 'bout you join them there?","media":null,"username":"sofiaquintero","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17